Author: mc3ds-bridge

Version:
    Major: 0
    Minor: 1
    Revision: 0

# Minecraft: New Nintendo 3DS Edition. Full title id 00040000001B8700 — note the low half also
# appears in the UDS wlan_comm_id (0x001B8710) the bridge already hardcodes.
Targets:
    - 0x001B8700

Title: Tonic3DS

Summary: Console side of Tonic - bridges MC3DS to a modern Java server (pairs with TonicJava)

Description: |
  Step 1 of running the MC3DS bridge on real hardware. Writes to sdmc:/tonic.log on load and
  every ten seconds after, and does nothing else. Confirms the plugin loads under this title, runs
  code, does I/O, and stays alive — all of which the UDS hook depends on.

Compatibility: Console

MemorySize: 5MiB

UsePrivateMemory: true
